# MovieRecommender2 — project context

## Goal

Stream MovieLens 25M dataset events through Kafka, persist interaction data in Postgres, and index movie catalog features in OpenSearch for search/recommendation.

## Dataset (`datasets/ml-25m/`, mounted at `/data` in Compose)

| File | Schema | Status |
|------|--------|--------|
| `ratings.csv` | userId, movieId, rating, timestamp | **In pipeline** (producer → Kafka → consumer → Postgres) |
| `tags.csv` | userId, movieId, tag, timestamp | **In pipeline** |
| `movies.csv` | movieId, title, genres (~62k rows) | **Bootstrap** via `index-catalog` → OpenSearch |

## Architecture

```text
ratings/tags → Kafka producer → Kafka → consumer → Postgres (events)

movies.csv → index-catalog (Job) → OpenSearch movies_vN → alias `movies`

recommender-api POST /movies → Postgres catalog_movies (pending_sync=true)
catalog-indexer-api POST /index/movie/{id} → OpenSearch (immediate sync via ?sync=immediate=true)
index-sync (Job) → bulk upsert pending rows to OpenSearch alias

recommender-api GET /search → OpenSearch alias
```

**Interview line:** CSV bootstraps the search index once; API-added catalog lives in Postgres as source of truth and syncs incrementally to OpenSearch. User events still stream via Kafka.

## Current stack

- **Kafka**, **Postgres 17**, **OpenSearch 2.19**
- **Producer / consumer** — ratings & tags; DLQ; health on `:8080`
- **Indexing** — `index-catalog` (CSV batch), `index-sync` (Postgres → OpenSearch)
- **Postgres** — `ratings_events`, `tag_events`, `dead_letter_events`, **`catalog_movies`**
- **recommender-api** — `GET /search`, `POST /movies`, `GET /catalog/pending-sync`, `/health` on `:8000`

### Compose profiles

| Profile | Services |
|---------|----------|
| `stream` / `ratings` / `tags` | Kafka pipeline |
| `catalog` | `index-catalog`, `index-sync`, `create-movie-index`, `index-movies` |
| `api` | `recommender-api`, `catalog-indexer-api` (+ `migrate`) |

**Runbook:**
1. `docker compose --profile catalog up --build index-catalog` (OpenSearch bootstrap)
2. `docker compose --profile api up --build recommender-api`
3. `POST /movies` → `docker compose --profile catalog run index-sync` (or `?sync=immediate=true` via catalog-indexer-api)

## Deferred

- `GET /recommend`, `POST /rate`
- Vector embeddings / `/search/similar`
- Postgres seed of ML-25m into `catalog_movies` (CSV only seeds OpenSearch today)

